{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07246","headline":"杂咏八首上礼部李侍郎 古劒 · 刘长卿","name":"杂咏八首上礼部李侍郎 古劒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙泉闲古匣，苔藓沦此地。\n何意久藏锋，翻令世人弃。\n铁衣今正涩，宝刃犹可试。\n傥遇拂拭恩，应知剸犀利。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}